NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001794 "Test::Class with additional conveniences to reduce need for some boilerplate code. Also makes L<Test::Most> testing functions available."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001795 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001796 "=item L<Test::Class::Moose>"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001797 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001798 "Testing framework allows you to write your tests in Moose and test Moose and non-Moose code.  It offers reporting, extensibility, test inheritance, parallel testing and more."
